{"page":140,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:95","surah":6,"ayah":95,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ فَالِقُ ٱلْحَبِّ وَٱلنَّوَىٰ ۖ يُخْرِجُ ٱلْحَىَّ مِنَ ٱلْمَيِّتِ وَمُخْرِجُ ٱلْمَيِّتِ مِنَ ٱلْحَىِّ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمُ ٱللَّهُ ۖ فَأَنَّىٰ تُؤْفَكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is God who splits open the seed and the fruit stone: He brings out the living from the dead and the dead from the living- that is God- so how can you turn away from the truth?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَالِقُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Cleaver","transliteration":"fāliqu","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَبِّ","en_gloss":"(of) the grain","transliteration":"l-ḥabi","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلنَّوَىٰ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the date-seed","transliteration":"wal-nawā","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُخْرِجُ","en_gloss":"He brings forth","transliteration":"yukh'riju","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَىَّ","en_gloss":"the living","transliteration":"l-ḥaya","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَيِّتِ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mayiti","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمُخْرِجُ","en_gloss":"and brings forth","transliteration":"wamukh'riju","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمَيِّتِ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mayiti","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحَىِّ ۚ","en_gloss":"the living","transliteration":"l-ḥayi","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālikumu","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَأَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"so how","transliteration":"fa-annā","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تُؤْفَكُونَ","en_gloss":"are you deluded","transliteration":"tu'fakūna","verse_key":"6:95"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٩٥","en_gloss":"(95)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:95"}]},{"verse_key":"6:96","surah":6,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"فَالِقُ ٱلْإِصْبَاحِ وَجَعَلَ ٱلَّيْلَ سَكَنًا وَٱلشَّمْسَ وَٱلْقَمَرَ حُسْبَانًا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ تَقْدِيرُ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْعَلِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He makes the dawn break; He makes the night for rest; and He made the sun and the moon to a precise measure. That is the design of the Almighty, the All Knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَالِقُ","en_gloss":"(He is the) Cleaver","transliteration":"fāliqu","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْإِصْبَاحِ","en_gloss":"(of) the daybreak","transliteration":"l-iṣ'bāḥi","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and He has made","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَكَنًۭا","en_gloss":"(for) rest","transliteration":"sakanan","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلشَّمْسَ","en_gloss":"and the sun","transliteration":"wal-shamsa","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","en_gloss":"and the moon","transliteration":"wal-qamara","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حُسْبَانًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(for) reckoning","transliteration":"ḥus'bānan","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَقْدِيرُ","en_gloss":"(is the) ordaining","transliteration":"taqdīru","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","en_gloss":"(of) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzi","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمِ","en_gloss":"the All-Knowing","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmi","verse_key":"6:96"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٩٦","en_gloss":"(96)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:96"}]},{"verse_key":"6:97","surah":6,"ayah":97,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلنُّجُومَ لِتَهْتَدُوا۟ بِهَا فِى ظُلُمَـٰتِ ٱلْبَرِّ وَٱلْبَحْرِ ۗ قَدْ فَصَّلْنَا ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لِقَوْمٍ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who made the stars, so that they can guide you when land and sea are dark: We have made the signs clear for those who have knowledge.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنُّجُومَ","en_gloss":"the stars","transliteration":"l-nujūma","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِتَهْتَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"that you may guide yourselves","transliteration":"litahtadū","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ظُلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the darkness[es]","transliteration":"ẓulumāti","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"(of) the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ ۗ","en_gloss":"and the sea","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَصَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have made clear","transliteration":"faṣṣalnā","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"(who) know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"6:97"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٩٧","en_gloss":"(97)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:97"}]},{"verse_key":"6:98","surah":6,"ayah":98,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنشَأَكُم مِّن نَّفْسٍ وَٰحِدَةٍ فَمُسْتَقَرٌّ وَمُسْتَوْدَعٌ ۗ قَدْ فَصَّلْنَا ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لِقَوْمٍ يَفْقَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who first produced you from a single soul, then gave you a place to stay [in life] and a resting place [after death]. We have made Our revelations clear to those who understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنشَأَكُم","en_gloss":"(has) produced you","transliteration":"ansha-akum","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَّفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"a soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"single","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمُسْتَقَرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"so (there is) a place of dwelling","transliteration":"famus'taqarrun","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمُسْتَوْدَعٌۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"and a resting place","transliteration":"wamus'tawdaʿun","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَصَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have made clear","transliteration":"faṣṣalnā","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"(who) understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"6:98"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٩٨","en_gloss":"(98)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:98"}]},{"verse_key":"6:99","surah":6,"ayah":99,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَخْرَجْنَا بِهِۦ نَبَاتَ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ فَأَخْرَجْنَا مِنْهُ خَضِرًا نُّخْرِجُ مِنْهُ حَبًّا مُّتَرَاكِبًا وَمِنَ ٱلنَّخْلِ مِن طَلْعِهَا قِنْوَانٌ دَانِيَةٌ وَجَنَّـٰتٍ مِّنْ أَعْنَابٍ وَٱلزَّيْتُونَ وَٱلرُّمَّانَ مُشْتَبِهًا وَغَيْرَ مُتَشَـٰبِهٍ ۗ ٱنظُرُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ ثَمَرِهِۦٓ إِذَآ أَثْمَرَ وَيَنْعِهِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكُمْ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who sends down water from the sky. With it We produce the shoots of each plant, then bring greenery from it, and from that We bring out grains, one riding on the other in close-packed rows. From the date palm come clusters of low-hanging dates, and there are gardens of vines, olives, and pomegranates, alike yet different. Watch their fruits as they grow and ripen! In all this there are signs for those who would believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"sends down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأَخْرَجْنَا","en_gloss":"then We bring forth","transliteration":"fa-akhrajnā","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَبَاتَ","en_gloss":"vegetation","transliteration":"nabāta","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"(of) every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":11,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَأَخْرَجْنَا","en_gloss":"Then We bring forth","transliteration":"fa-akhrajnā","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنْهُ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"6:99"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَضِرًۭا","en_