","en_gloss":"though He has created them","transliteration":"wakhalaqahum","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَخَرَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they falsely attribute","transliteration":"wakharaqū","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَنِينَ","en_gloss":"sons","transliteration":"banīna","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَبَنَـٰتٍۭ","en_gloss":"and daughters","transliteration":"wabanātin","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عِلْمٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"Glorified is He","transliteration":"sub'ḥānahu","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ","en_gloss":"and Exalted","transliteration":"wataʿālā","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"above what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَصِفُونَ","en_gloss":"they attribute","transliteration":"yaṣifūna","verse_key":"6:100"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٠٠","en_gloss":"(100)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:100"}]},{"verse_key":"6:101","surah":6,"ayah":101,"ar_uthmani":"بَدِيعُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ أَنَّىٰ يَكُونُ لَهُۥ وَلَدٌ وَلَمْ تَكُن لَّهُۥ صَـٰحِبَةٌ ۖ وَخَلَقَ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ ۖ وَهُوَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"the Creator of the heavens and earth! How could He have children when He has no spouse, when He created all things, and has full knowledge of all things?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَدِيعُ","en_gloss":"Originator","transliteration":"badīʿu","verse_key":"6:101"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"6:101"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"6:101"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"How","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"6:101"